@startuml selma_inspection_pipeline
' ============================================================
' Selma — Inspection Execution Pipeline
' Source:  SPECIFICATION.md §2.10–§2.13, §3.3, §3.6, §3.7
'          User_Stories.md S-10, S-15, S-16
' C4:      Rule Inspector → Snapshots Adapter → artifact_store
'          Rule Inspector → Lifecycle Finder (finding birth)
' Contract: 8.2.4
'
' Six pure stages. Reinspect creates a NEW inspection_id;
' prior snapshots remain immutable. Process FSM (not a durable
' multi-day lifecycle aggregate).
' ============================================================

title Selma — Inspection Execution Pipeline\n<size:12><i>Six-stage pure evaluation · typed faults · immutable snapshot + HLC findings</i></size>

!include ./common/sm_styles.puml

[*] --> Submitted : <b>inspection.submit</b>\nor inspection.reinspect\nactor: Compliance Rep | System\nstory: S-10 / S-15

state "Submitted" as Submitted #B9770E : target payload received
state "Ingress\nGranted" as IngressGranted #1B7A6E : capability OK\ntarget schema OK\npoint-in-time pins set
state "Rejected\nIngress" as RejectedIngress #A93226 : 403 | SchemaError\n**no snapshot · no findings**
state "1. Normalize" as Normalize #1B7A6E : NFC · UTC · IEEE 754\ntarget_hash computed
state "2. Classify" as Classify #1B7A6E : target_type mapping\ncontext enrichment
state "3. Select\nControls" as SelectControls #1B7A6E : scope filter CG-IR\ndeps ready · severity gate
state "4. Evaluate" as Evaluate #1B7A6E : topological DAG\npure evaluators only\nPass|Fail|Partial|NeedsReview
state "5. Aggregate" as Aggregate #1B7A6E : deontic × outcome\nconflict apply\nseverity mapping
state "6. Report" as Report #2C6E49 : append findings\nwrite snapshot + trace\nsystem_state_hash
state "Completed" as Completed #2C6E49 : status=completed
state "Partial" as Partial #B9770E : status=partial\nskipped_nodes present
state "Failed" as Failed #A93226 : status=failed\nCG-IR corruption / fatal

Submitted --> IngressGranted : grant\n[capability_enforced]
Submitted --> RejectedIngress : deny

RejectedIngress --> [*]

IngressGranted --> Normalize : pin\ntarget_hash\ncg_ir_snapshot_hash\nfrozen_env_hash\nengine_version

Normalize --> Classify : OK
Normalize --> Report : fault → typed finding\nSchema | Corruption

Classify --> SelectControls : OK
Classify --> Report : fault → Schema

SelectControls --> Evaluate : OK
SelectControls --> Report : Dependency\nskipped_nodes (no finding)

Evaluate --> Aggregate : OK
Evaluate --> Evaluate : timeout retry\n0..3 (default 0)
Evaluate --> Report : fault findings\nDeterministic | Ambiguous\nTimeout | Resource

Aggregate --> Report : OK or partial aggregate\n(always report)

Report --> Completed : full success
Report --> Partial : partial results\n(skipped_nodes present)
Report --> Failed : Fatal CG-IR corruption

Completed --> [*]
Partial --> [*]
Failed --> [*]

note left of IngressGranted
  **Point-in-time pin (S-10)**
  system_state_hash = SHA-256({
    directive_graph_version,
    cg_ir_hash,
    frozen_env_hash,
    engine_version,
    target_hash
  })
  Event stream ordering is **excluded**
  from system_state_hash (§2.17).
end note

note right of Evaluate
  **Evaluator contract (§2.9)**
  · pure · deterministic · no IO
  · no randomness · no env reads
  · RE2-compatible regex only
  Parallel independent nodes OK.
  Dependency-failed nodes → Skipped
  trace entry only (no cascading finding).
end note

note bottom of Report
  **Fault taxonomy (§3.3)**
  Deterministic · Partial · Ambiguous · Dependency
  Timeout · Resource · Schema · Corruption
  Findings born at Report → Lifecycle Finder
  (Finding FSM Created). Snapshot is write-once
  in artifact_store. Reinspect = new instance.
end note

@enduml
